WEBVTT

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.400
There's nowhere left for you to run!

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.300
Say your prayers!

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.870
Stop right there!

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.210
Precure, Smile Char-

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.580
Cut, cut, cut!

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.780
What do you think you're doing, Miss?

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.530
I take it you're visiting the Park?

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.960
Miyuki...

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.780
Keep off the set!

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.320
We're filming!

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.660
What the heck are you doin'...

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.840
I'm really sorry about this!

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.160
Alright, take two!

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:43.860
Okay!

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.540
Try an' control yerself, Miyuki.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.140
My bad...

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:48.030
But you know...

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:52.870
I can't believe we get to watch them film a movie! This is so exciting!

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.630
Yeah, it is!

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:58.040
I wish I could be in a movie too!

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.500
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.340
Smile Precure!

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:05.240
Let's go!

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:06.780
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:07.910
All together!

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:09.510
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:11.710
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.380
Smile Precure!

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.220
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:24.660
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:29.860
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:35.800
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:40.740
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:40.710
So bright!

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:45.910
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:52.350
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:52.850
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:54.020
Let's go!

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.730
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:59.660
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:04.470
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:05.030
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.700
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:07.840
Everybody!

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:09.500
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:12.040
Fly to the future!

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:15.540
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:17.710
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:20.020
Smile Precure!

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:29.220
We've come here for a tour of the filming at Period Drama Studio Park!

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.930
And Pop's joined us, too!

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:42.200
So these are the samurai movies I've heard so much about!

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:45.600
This is a monster movie rather than a samurai one, though.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:51.580
There's this really cool scene where this female ninja — a kunoichi — takes out a big monster!

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:55.240
Though, uh, Pop... Weren'tcha supposed to be gettin' back to Märchenland?

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:59.920
Nay! Passing up the chance to lend myself to a samurai movie would be an eternal stain upon my conscience!

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:03.090
Alright, sure! But ya know you ain't actually gonna be in it, right?

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:06.760
I've got you caught in my web now, kunoichi!

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:09.230
You dare show yourself, Siren Spider?!

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:11.160
I shall vanquish thee!

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:17.640
Siren Spider!

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:20.010
Get your hands off Yayoi!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.800
What's the matter, director?

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:28.380
Eureka!

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:28.380
Director!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.950
You there! Would you girls like to be in a movie?

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.660
I-In a movie?!

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.080
Alright, I'm in costume!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.840
Perfect! The belle of the city if ever I saw one!

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.210
Y-You really think so...?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.780
Sorry I had to drop this all on you so suddenly.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.900
But seeing you five just filled my head with brilliant new ideas!

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:05.550
Oh, I'm ultra happy I can help! I've always wanted to be in a movie!

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.790
Ahem! Would you care to come inside for some dumplings, Sir?

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:11.760
You look adorable!

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.080
If I may...

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.200
I cannot help but feel that being the princess...

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.600
...may be a role too important for me...

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.040
No, you make the perfect princess!

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.920
You're so pretty...

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.160
W-Who are you?!

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.950
I am the Siren Spider!

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:36.150
Wait, why the heck do I gotta be the villain?!

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.560
The curtain rises for Kunoichi Nao!

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:42.120
I'm throwing down the gauntlet!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.200
You're so cool, Nao!

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.080
H-Hey, what about me?!

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.290
You're all perfect for the parts!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:50.000
Alright, I'll see you all on set!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.680
Okay!

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.520
My friends...

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.940
Do we know you?

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:04.040
I roam free, with but the wind as my guide...

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:09.000
My name is Pop the Wanderer!

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.990
Whoa, you can turn into a human too?!

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:14.660
You look so cool!

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.960
You're so cool, Onii-chan, kuru!

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.660
W-Well, I'm not really...

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:19.860
...able to deny that-de gozaru.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.480
Allow me to join you in this production-de gozaru.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:27.730
A period drama must tell the story of a man who lives by the sword!

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:31.300
And now, I have a chance to prove it permeates my very way of life-de gozaru!

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.310
It ain't really that kinda movie, though...

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.600
Alright, everybody ready!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.340
Director-dono!

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.280
Yeah?

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.100
I would like to request a role in this feature too-de gozaru.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.390
You're a cute little thing, aren't you?

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:53.420
I am a man! A proud man, who strives to cast away the label of "cute"-de gozaru!

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.280
Well then, you'd better prove that to the camera!

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:00.560
You've got gusto, kid, and I like it!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:02.470
Oh, I'm not really...

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:03.440
...able to deny that!

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:05.770
The heck? You ain't this cocky normally!

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:08.280
I want to be in a movie too-kuru...

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.340
Hey!

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:13.280
What exactly is that thing? It's been on my mind since I saw you girls!

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:16.380
O-Oh, it's just a little plushie of mine!

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.960
Well, it's very cute!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:21.840
I think we could include her as a kind-hearted monster working with the humans!

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:25.120
I'm a fairy, not a monster-kuru!

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:32.070
Our cast is assembled! Let's take this for a spin!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.970
So, in this scene, the princess is taking refuge at the dumpling shop

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:38.170
when the kunoichi makes an appearance to save her from the monster.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.660
We are ready to roll!

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.540
What?! No rehearsals?!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.580
The director likes doing things spontaneously, apparently.

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.980
Does he actually know what the heck he's doin...?

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:52.100
Lights, camera, action!

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.120
Is everything to your liking, Madame?

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.130
It's very good! I'm ultra happy!

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.820
English in a period drama...? You for real...?

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:02.640
Shall we stop filming?

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.800
No, no, this is good! Keep it rolling!

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:06.270
Help me!

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.800
Please, somebody, you have to help me!

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.240
What's the matter, Reika?

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:12.710
I'm being hounded by a paranormal poltergeist!

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:14.620
P-Paranormal poltergeist?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.410
What?

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.820
You ain't thinkin' of gettin' away from me, are ya, Princess?

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.350
Wait, you're using your Osakan dialect?

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.150
Maybe she's an Osakarachnid!

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:29.480
That line isn't even in the script!

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.020
But it's good, I like it! Let's roll with it!

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.470
Hold it!

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.360
The kunoichi is here!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.030
I shall protect you, Princess!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:38.930
The heck?

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.400
I'm throwing down the gauntlet!

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:42.160
Bring it on!

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.140
Kunoichi Shot!

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.070
Siren Spider Fire!

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:48.640
You can beat her!

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:51.880
This is hopeless!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.180
I think you mean amazing!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.320
I lost...

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.970
Guess that means I'm takin' your princess!

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:04.020
Stop right there!

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.090
The heck are you?!

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:10.800
I roam free, with but the wind as my guide! I am known...

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:17.200
...as Pop the Wanderer, at your service-de gozaru!

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:19.870
Alright!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.520
Alright, that's more like it!

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.280
You're so cool, Onii-chan, kuru!

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:24.600
Am I even going to be in this...?

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:25.900
Director, please!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.250
Shut up! It's just getting good!

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:31.240
Your villainy will be permitted not a second longer!

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:34.520
Let us do battle-de gozaru!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.360
Fine by me!

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:49.440
I-I lost...

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:52.540
Yet again, I'm forced to cut down a worthless foe-de gozaru...

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.620
Thank you so much for saving us!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.860
You're really strong!

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:00.200
Alas, I must take my leave.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.680
Would you at least tell us your name?

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.620
My name is Pop the Wanderer. Though the name is of little consequence...

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.260
He's so cool!

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:11.100
Then why bother givin' it?!

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:12.580
Farewell, my friends!

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.320
Thank you, Pop!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:18.100
Thank you so much!

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.600
Cut!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.020
Oh boy...

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:28.810
We're gonna get roasted...

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:29.680
Yeah...

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.710
I'm so sorry!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.780
We messed up your entire script!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.080
That was absolutely incredible!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.350
What?!

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:41.980
You girls are redefining my entire image for this movie!

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:44.390
Would you mind being in a few more scenes?

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:51.640
Pitiful humans! You are powerless before Aooni-sama!

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:56.700
That's it!-oni That's why you're the star of the oni world, Aooni-sama! Blue! Blue!

00:09:56.900 --> 00:10:00.440
I wish I could beat those humans black and blue too-oni!

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:03.180
Come and visit us at the Period Drama Studio Park!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:03.720
I will! I promise, I will!

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:08.250
If I go, I'll get to meet Aooni-sama in the flesh-oni!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.320
Then what the heck am I waiting for-oni?!

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.280
I'll be there soon-oni!

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.560
Candy!

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:25.520
Akanbe!

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:29.770
This is it-oni!

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.200
Oni?

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.720
There he is-oni! Aooni-sama, in the flesh-oni!

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:37.940
Bluey! Bluey!

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:40.610
My hero, Aooni-sama!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.720
I'm a huge fan of yours-oni!

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:46.520
T-Thank you very much! That's, umm, a very well made costume.

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:47.660
Costume?

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:48.520
Oni?

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.740
On to the next scene!

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:52.960
Are those...

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.330
...the Precure?

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.430
No, that's stupid-oni!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.270
Wow...

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:14.650
One really appreciates how movies are shaped by the attention to detail from the entire crew.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:19.320
Alright then, time for the final scene!

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:24.520
The people of the town band together to fight off the invading monstrous hordes!

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.690
Lights, camera...

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:28.160
Action!

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:33.900
This town is now under the control of our Monster Army!

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:37.870
Come, my people! We must unite and fight off this vile menace!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.670
The heck?

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:43.240
Who is that?!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:47.060
Wow! I never knew...

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.420
I never knew this world had so many bad monsters like me in it-oni!

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:51.700
It's Akaoni-kuru!

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.160
What's he doing here?!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.620
Let me help you-oni!

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:58.090
Come on, let's do this-oni!

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.980
Incredible! It's so visceral!

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:08.530
I don't remember us casting him...

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:11.140
Quit whining and keep those cameras on him!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.400
Why are you running from me, Aooni-sama, oni?

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:17.420
Stop that at once!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.380
Oni?

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:23.120
Do you know where you stand? This is a hallowed place for film-lovers, the Period Drama Studio Park!

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.980
I knew it! You are the Precure-oni!

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:28.840
I didn't recognize you in those crazy getups-oni!

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:31.580
Yeah, we are! And we're tryin' to film a movie!

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:35.120
A movie? Wait, then this is all just a set-oni?

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.460
We will not allow you to sabotage this film!

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.060
Indeed we shan't-de gozaru!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.240
Who are you meant to be-oni?

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:45.520
I roam free, with but the wind as my guide!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:50.060
I am Pop the Wanderer, at your service-de gozaru!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.080
Oh boy, he's back...

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.180
My friends...

00:12:57.680 --> 00:13:02.120
This red oni you see before you wishes for nothing more than for our movie to have a bad ending!

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:07.060
I believe it is time for humans and monsters to unite and make a stand-de gozaru!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:14.930
This is the coolest damn thing ever!

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:16.620
I've been duped-oni!

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:18.340
Fine then!

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:21.370
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:24.110
...a Bad End-oni!

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:28.350
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-oni!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.490
Movies are just boring anyway...

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:43.960
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama, oni!

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:51.720
We've worked so hard on this movie! We are not gonna let you ruin it!

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.300
Come on, girls!

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.440
Right!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.410
Ready?

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.760
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:03.760
Go!

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.040
Go, go!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:07.960
Let's go!

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:34.820
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.920
Cure Happy!

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:42.380
Dazzling sun!

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.580
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.340
Cure Sunny!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:53.040
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:56.040
Cure Peace!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.620
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.640
Cure March!

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:10.580
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.560
Cure Beauty!

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:18.060
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:28.430
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:33.420
Come on out, Hyper Akanbe!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.560
I feel super strong now-oni!

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:50.320
Hyper Akanbe!

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:51.740
A black nose again?!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.020
Be on your guard.

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:55.260
I'm gonna beat those Precure to a pulp-oni!

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:01.170
Stop!

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:02.770
Hy—!

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:05.140
What the—?!

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:06.610
I can't move!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.310
Rewind!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:09.140
—per!

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.410
Stop!

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:17.280
We stopped... but now I can't move...

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:23.090
I'm forced to interpret that his Akanbe has the ability to control our actions...

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:24.760
Ain't that cheatin'?

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:26.460
What are we going to do?

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.140
Time to finish you!

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:31.440
Akanbe!

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:33.360
Halt!

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.140
Pop?

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.300
Who are you?

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:42.460
Your countless acts of violence will not go unpunished-de gozaru!

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:45.220
I will pass judgement!

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:46.010
To battle!

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:47.210
Hyper?!

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:51.750
The Order of Märchen's Fairy Slash-de gozaru!

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:54.620
Wha—?!

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:59.380
You broke my blade! My beloved Märchen Masamune!

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:02.960
The heck kinda name is that?! Besides, it's only a prop!

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.130
Leave this to me-kuru!

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:08.420
Let's Go: Elephant!

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:11.120
Go get him!

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:19.550
You call that an attack-oni?

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:22.880
Oni?

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:24.420
What happened-oni?!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:28.190
The camera's an appliance. It's destroyed if it gets wet!

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:29.390
Nice one, Candy!

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.120
Kuru.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.630
Oh crap, I hit fast forward by mistake!

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:38.960
Whoa, we're going super fast!

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:40.580
A'ight then, let's take him!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:41.420
Ready?

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:42.140
Akanbe?!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:43.420
Go!

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.410
They're even faster than normal now!

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.060
Hyper!

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.980
Now we're back to normal speed!

00:17:57.020 --> 00:18:04.020
Everyone's put their hearts into this movie! We'll protect it... <i>no matter what!</i>

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:10.820
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:27.800
Princess Happy!

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.950
Princess Sunny!

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:32.140
Princess Peace!

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:34.350
Princess March!

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:36.560
Princess Beauty!

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:44.440
Precure: Princess Form!

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:53.160
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:57.360
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:13.030
May the light of hope shine!

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:16.800
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:23.200
Precure...

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:27.360
Royal Rainbow...

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:30.240
Burst!

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:37.880
Akanbe...!

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:46.760
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:00.040
We've got another new Décor-kuru!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:03.820
These black noses really tire you out-oni!

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.380
I'm done with your stupid movie, anyway-oni!

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:11.260
Really, thank you, girls!

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:13.950
We've shot one fantastic movie thanks to you five!

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:16.000
Make sure you come to the press showing!

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.420
We will! Thank you very much!

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:21.240
Miyuki, the heck are we gonna do about that camera?

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:24.460
It was filmin' the whole thing!

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.700
Oh god, what are we gonna do?!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.060
No need to worry.

00:20:29.340 --> 00:20:31.040
Pop!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.040
What's that?

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.510
The very tape they were recording with.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:39.920
I'll erase any sections containing the Precure, and return it before they know it's gone-de gozaru yo.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:41.980
Thank goodness...

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.650
Onii-chan's really something-kuru!

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:52.530
Without further ado, we present the finished version of our new movie, Monster All Stars DX!

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:55.140
We hope you enjoy all it has to offer!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:02.480
Monster All Stars DX!

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:06.170
I roam free, with but the wind as my guide!

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:11.060
I am Pop the Wanderer, at your service-de gozaru!

00:21:14.150 --> 00:21:17.950
I believe it is time for humans and monsters to unite and make a stand-de gozaru!

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:19.920
That's my Onii-chan, kuru!

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:24.120
Your countless acts of violence will not go unpunished-de gozaru!

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:26.160
I will pass judgement!

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:26.860
To battle!

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:32.300
The Order of Märchen's Fairy Slash-de gozaru!

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:36.460
Alas, I must take my leave.

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:39.030
Would you at least tell us your name...?

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:43.510
My name is Pop the Wanderer. Though the name is of little consequence...

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:49.420
Are you serious?

00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:51.620
That was all about Pop!

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.550
Because Pop's so cool-kuru!

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.220
I think I'm gonna give up acting...

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:04.440
Movies are truly wonderous things, are they not-de gozaru?

00:23:39.280 --> 00:23:41.100
It's time for our culture festival!

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:42.320
What's that-kuru?

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:43.860
It's like one big school party!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.760
And our class is holdin' a fashion show!

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:47.090
Leave the designing to me!

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:49.760
But one of the boys, Toyoshima, refuses to take part!

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:52.320
Now what shall we do? Our class's plan is in jeopardy!

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:57.080
I want us all to do this together! We'll just have to find a way to make everyone happy!

00:23:57.400 --> 00:23:58.940
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:04.160
Find your ultra happy smile!
